{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1193857-skin-deep-modification-ideas","id":1193857,"title":"Skin Deep Modification Ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-10T02:44:38-08:00","id":1193857,"title":"Skin Deep Modification Ideas","content":"So BPG is out, and one of my favourite additions is the Skin Deep Atavism.<br /> Being able to go physical horror is just too good to pass on, and the versitality of it is intriguing.<br /> <br /> That said, we are presented 7 different possible modifications, and I thought this is the right spot to see if we cannot come up with more =)<br /> We already have<br /> - a fall-slowing modification<br /> - literal eyes in the back of the head (+2 on sight-based rolls)<br /> - improved grabbing for both grappling and climbing via prehensile limbs<br /> - tough hide downgrading 2L into 2B each turn<br /> - speedbuff of Lair+2<br /> - growing claws, unarmed attacks dealing 1L (+1 to climbing)<br /> - bite attacks don't need a grapple and deal Lethal damage<br /> <br /> What I came up with (although not sure regarding Balance with some):<br /> Growing an enlarged or elongated head to support a more powerful brain, +1 dice on Investigation and Science rolls.<br /> Growing antennas to pick up &quot;vibes&quot;, +2 on Empathy and the ability to roll for characters out of sight (e.g. around the corner).<br /> Temporarily grow larger, gaining 1 HP.<br /> Growing suckers/spiderhair on the inside of his hands, negating negative modifiers for surfaces or lack of tools when climbing.<br /> Having eyes turn an unnatural colour (completely black, red, Sith-yellow, eye-stalks coming out etc.) to gain a bonus on Intimidate.<br /> Growing pins/needles/thorns etc. on the skin, so that each unarmed attack received returns 1 Bashing damage.<br /> Flesh turns oozy, attacks are more likely to not deal any damage at all. +2 Bonus to Defense.<br /> Arms grow longer, giving the character the ability to interact with things from 2 yards away.<br /> Fingers are replaced by tiny hands, whose fingers in turn are replaced by tinier hands. Situations that call for extremely delicate motor control enjoy 9-again.<br /> Retractable limbs: Character can pull his limbs inside to a certain degree, allowing him to fit into spaces he'd usually couldn't. -1 to size for purposes of deciding whether the character fits or not.<br /> Camo Skin: +2 on Stealth<br /> <br /> What ideas can you come up with? Let's pool! =D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8542,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","user":"Wormwood","date":". 03-10-2018, 05:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T05:50:14-08:00","id":1193891,"title":"","content":"- Eyes swirling with colours in a Kaa-esque fashion (+2 to Persuasion - <i>&quot;Trusssst in meeee...</i><i> Jusssst in </i><i>meeee</i><i>...</i>)<br /> - Hair growing to floor-length and lashing back and forth, entangling enemies' weapons (+2 Defense bonus)<br /> - Gaining innumerable subdermal muscles, allowing low-level reshaping of shape like an octopus (+2 to disguise attempts)<br /> - A USB or other connector extruded from a fingertip (+2 Computers - for more technological Horrors)<br /> - A canine muzzle and nose (+2 to Survival rolls related to tracking)<br /> - Alien equations and mathematical theorems float in the air around the Beast's head (+2 to Academics - for AIs or Horrors that 'think a thousand times faster than you')<br /> <br /> I know that some of those are duplicate effects, but I've always been better at fluff than crunch, and I think the different ideas of how something could manifest are worthwhile as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T20:29:19-08:00","id":1194127,"title":"","content":"<ul><li>Eyes become larger, with slit or triangular pupils and a shine or faint glow. +2 to sight-based checks in low light or darkness.</li> <li>Skin becomes coated in slime or mucus; attacker takes -2 on any attempt to grapple, Beast gains +2 on a roll to Break Free.</li> <li>Saliva becomes a poison with Toxicity equal to Lair/2 rounded down. Applies Poisoned (Grave) if used in conjunction with a bite attack, or Poisoned (Moderate) if spit.</li> <li>Blood or saliva becomes acidic, dealing 1L damage.</li> <li>All joints become hypermobile, giving the Beast +2 to a grapple role to Break Free and allowing her to squeeze through any opening that will accomodate her head (though if this means e.g. crawling through a pipe, she moves at half her usual Speed).</li> </ul><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T00:54:05-08:00","id":1194170,"title":"","content":"Duplicates are fine! After all, what works for one Beast may not for the other =)<br /> Plus it gives a starting point for other ideas!<br /> <br /> - Growing an enourmous or extremely long tongue - tasting things gives the Beast insight of their (al)chemical composition and thus an understanding of how they work (Beast learns what conditions and tilts ingesting this stuff would cause)<br /> - Giant Ears: +3 to hearing-based rolls (but also -3 to resist deafening)<br /> - Bat Ears: +2 to moving in total darkness due to echolocation.<br /> - thickening muscles: + 1 on athletics and brawl rolls<br /> - elongated forearms with short, thick upper arms: 9-again on Throwing rolls<br /> - cat-like legs: Bonus of Lair+2 to Initiative roll<br /> - long fingers: Larceny +2<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T01:14:02-08:00","id":1194177,"title":"","content":"Some great ideas in here, Well done everyone, keep them coming! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T01:16:37-08:00","id":1194178,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1193857-skin-deep-modification-ideas?p=1194177#post1194177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some great ideas in here, Well done everyone, keep them coming! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Your wish is my command!<ul><li>Feline legs and paws (+2 to Stealth - <i>With catlike tread...</i>)</li> <li>Exoskeleton (2/1 armour rating)</li> <li>Dragon scales (2/1 armour rating)</li> <li>Hands flickering with fire (2L damage with unarmed attacks (also done to weapons, held items etc))</li> <li>Feet turn into roots (take the Immobilised condition in exchange for regenerating 1B per turn and 1L per 15 minutes)</li> <li>Forked tongue (+1 to Survival rolls related to tracking, +1 to Empathy when discerning emotions)</li> <li>Dislocatable jaw (become able to swallow and regurgitate without damage (besides water damage) objects of up to Size 2 - Think Orochimaru)</li> <li>Eyes on stalks (+1 to perception rolls related to sight, able to look around corners - I can't help but picture the parasites from <i>Parasyte</i>)</li> <li>Legs turn into a snakelike tail (+1 to swimming rolls, immunity to being tripped etc)</li> <li>Gills (can breathe in water - I know you're likely to have a Lair Trait or Heart of the Ocean which can give you this anyway, but I think It's worth mentioning it as another possibility)</li> <li>Glorious light (+2 to Intimidation)</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T03:27:43-07:00","id":1194196,"title":"","content":"- growing spider legs: 8-again on Dext+Athletics rolls<br /> - Additional specialized Limbs: +2 to brawl OR +2 to crafts OR +2 to Athletics OR +2 to Larceny....<br /> - Scaly Hide: Immune to Fire Damage up to a rating of 3<br /> - black veins: +2 to resistance against drugs, poisons and diseases<br /> - Eye membrane: good vision under water<br /> - Mirrored eye membrane: Penalty to all rolls that need eye contact (e.g. Dominate, Nightmares) of -2<br /> - Horns: Access to Headbutt move (stuns on success), + no longer needs to establish a grapple. Deals +0L<br /> - spiked whip: extend an intestine from the belly button with a large spige at the end. Can be used as a +0L weapon. When Successes &gt; Dexterity, Opponent suffers Knocked Down.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T15:59:28-07:00","id":1198873,"title":"","content":"Besides some really kinky tricks to try in the bedroom, there's just so many possibilities with powers like Skin Deep or CtL's Odd Body. On another thread, I wrote up a question regarding one idea I had. Tell me what you think.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrParaduo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/863020-inspirational-images-for-beast?p=1198766#post1198766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Question: is it possible, through the Skin Deep Atavism, to create a sort of &quot;mouthpiece&quot; that would allow someone inside your Lair to speak and/or interact with the real world? Imagine having a hacker inside your lair, and you create a sort of 'conjoined twin' out of your gut so said-hacker could help you break into someone's computer, without risking said-Hacker being publicly seen or harmed? Or if you wanted to negotiate with your enemy by showing you have a hostage, but in the most horrifying way possible?<br /> <br /> An example visual:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/uZ_R1-mOuZJrr7t_rB5O-iMvr6WHze_vatQgFZwWA0R6Jt1JOzRSWJ7gCM7KbmytyFCEVLUzFfcBkJsDnKdadBMMKQH0kPMSJ9LmPPRby-utOIsKYqYMZymjQQhdDNfEa87ZbzOQyCEv04L-tXykzw=w1200-h630-p-k-no-nu\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T16:03:41-07:00","id":1198875,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrParaduo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1193857-skin-deep-modification-ideas?p=1198873#post1198873\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Besides some really kinky tricks to try in the bedroom, there's just so many possibilities with powers like Skin Deep or CtL's Odd Body. On another thread, I wrote up a question regarding one idea I had. Tell me what you think.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>The one problem I see with that usage is that you decide on your modifications when you buy the Atavism (and when you level up) so I'm not sure it would work with someone you're just keeping in there. If the mini-someone is a Thrall, though, (as in, from the Lair Trait) I could see that working.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T16:37:47-07:00","id":1198887,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1193857-skin-deep-modification-ideas?p=1198875#post1198875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The one problem I see with that usage is that you decide on your modifications when you buy the Atavism (and when you level up) so I'm not sure it would work with someone you're just keeping in there. If the mini-someone is a Thrall, though, (as in, from the Lair Trait) I could see that working.</div> </div> </div> </div>From what I've read in the book, you're not limited to specific modifications, only the number of which you can manifest and maintain at a given time (which is dependent on your dot rating in Lair).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T22:32:57-07:00","id":1198962,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1193857-skin-deep-modification-ideas?p=1198875#post1198875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The one problem I see with that usage is that you decide on your modifications when you buy the Atavism (and when you level up)</div> </div> </div> </div>Unless it changed at the last minute prior to publishing*, no you don\u2019t.<br /> <br /> * I haven\u2019t received my comp copy yet, so it\u2019s possible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T22:35:10-07:00","id":1198964,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrParaduo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1193857-skin-deep-modification-ideas?p=1198873#post1198873\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Besides some really kinky tricks to try in the bedroom, there's just so many possibilities with powers like Skin Deep or CtL's Odd Body. On another thread, I wrote up a question regarding one idea I had. Tell me what you think.</div> </div> </div> </div>Technically, no. <br /> <br /> Golden rule applies to your game, of course.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-24T10:56:21-07:00","id":1199117,"title":"","content":"How about one where your head merges with your torso, preventing decapitation?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-24T11:02:35-07:00","id":1199120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrParaduo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1193857-skin-deep-modification-ideas?p=1199117#post1199117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about one where your head merges with your torso, preventing decapitation?</div> </div> </div> </div>That, or a detachable head that walks, Thing-style. Or both, because options are always good<br /> <br /> (Better to put it back into place before the Atavism ends, though!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/