tion. Bonuses to contortionism would be more than workable, though. Maybe the ability to count as 1 or 2 Sizes smaller for the purposes of squeezing through things?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-24T11:48:22-07:00","id":1199132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1193857-skin-deep-modification-ideas?p=1199131#post1199131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's what Infestation is for. This seems like it would be a bit too powerful a modification. Bonuses to contortionism would be more than workable, though. Maybe the ability to count as 1 or 2 Sizes smaller for the purposes of squeezing through things?</div> </div> </div> </div>Righto. Fair deal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-24T12:23:50-07:00","id":1199145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1193857-skin-deep-modification-ideas?p=1199131#post1199131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's what Infestation is for. This seems like it would be a bit too powerful a modification. Bonuses to contortionism would be more than workable, though. Maybe the ability to count as 1 or 2 Sizes smaller for the purposes of squeezing through things?</div> </div> </div> </div>I had suggested one for &quot;hyper-mobile joints&quot; that lets you squeeze through any opening that can fit your head...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-25T02:04:55-07:00","id":1199331,"title":"","content":"Detachable hands, Adams family style! Those would be so useful! <br /> <br /> The hyper-mobile joints Seemed A Bit powerful, As You Could Near Replicate the normal effect of Infestation.<br /> It would work perfectly fine as an assortment or modifications, though!<br /> <br /> Growing a spine sword, which can be used as a +1 lethal sword, but also as a whip or grapple hook.<br /> Shooting Bone shards from your hand/fingers, dealing ranged bashing damage. (Yes, Kimimaro-style).<br /> Growing a shield on one arm, providing 3/3 armor against attacks that Are blocked With it.<br /> Ink glands as a Defense Mechanism under water.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T03:36:42-07:00","id":1199647,"title":"","content":"Spores - the beast leaves large amounts of spores in it's wake, which cause those who breathe them in to suffer a condition or tilt (sick/poisoned/sleepy/hyper/delusional etc.)<br /> Green skin - as long as a part Equal to the upper body is touched by sunlight, the beast does not need food or air. Alternatively, the Beast's endurance is increased, causing it to never tire while in sunlight (no penalties due to staying awake, running, exhaustion from environment etc.)<br /> Primal eyes (think nautilus or Zerg Overmind eyes) - sacrifices normal Vision for infrared, allowing the beast to see through thin Walls and notice sources of warmth in complete darkness.<br /> Slick- all attempts to grapple the target Suffer -2<br /> Heavy body - whether it is made from metal, stone, or covered in scales, something makes the beast heavier. Attempts to move them Suffer -2, and recoil affects them less (+2 to shooting heavy firearms). However, moving around is harder - he loses 4 speed and 2 initiative.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> With Green skin, Size up, strong arms and bulging muscles, and tough skin, we could finally reenact the hulk :-)<br /> <br /> Now we just need some more things for our Bug, mushroom and tree/plant monsters.<br /> <br /> <br /> How about this: <br /> living colony: the beast's body houses Swarms of insects that they can command. Apply the Swarm tilt up to a a distance of lair+1 yards around the beast.<br /> <br /> Strong legs: gain +1 to Athletics rolls. Furthermore, when jumping, add Lair +2 to the distance the Beast Can jump<br /> <br /> Enlarged shoulder: can throw much more powerfully. Add beasts Lair +1 to the distance and take +1 to rolls for throwing stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8542,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","user":"Wormwood","date":". 03-26-2018, 06:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T05:33:19-07:00","id":1199668,"title":"","content":"I think we should try to steer clear of mimicking other atavisms","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T07:03:31-07:00","id":1199701,"title":"","content":"Well, considering 3 of the given examples Also provided in the BPG somewhat low powered versions of existing Atavisms (Wings if the Raptor, Unbreakable, low satiety limb from limb) I think it is fair to try to do something similar if it is still significantly weaker and or different enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T09:03:44-07:00","id":1199727,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I wonder if Skin Deep is too powerful. I feel like it needs some limits. As is, a sufficiently creative player with this Atavism alone would have all the powers they need to combat (not just physically) at least some minor templates.<br /> <br /> Like, Spores are cool, but it sounds like a more powerful/long-lasting version of Normal Satiety Touch of the Basilisk, in that you can coat an area in it rather than having to touch a person directly<br /> <br /> EDIT: Hmm, forgot that you choose a number of mods when you buy the Atavism, not just have whatever mods you can think of. Rethinking my position a little bit<br /> <br /> EDIT: Checked it again. That's not how it works. You have a limited number of mods you can apply at once, but no fixed set of mods.<br /> <br /> Also, I think Shields add to Defense instead of giving armor","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":7920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","user":"Master Aquatosic","date":". 03-26-2018, 12:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T09:39:34-07:00","id":1199737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1193857-skin-deep-modification-ideas?p=1199727#post1199727\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, I wonder if Skin Deep is too powerful. I feel like it needs some limits. As is, a sufficiently creative player with this Atavism alone would have all the powers they need to combat (not just physically) at least some minor templates.<br /> <br /> Like, Spores are cool, but it sounds like a more powerful/long-lasting version of Normal Satiety Touch of the Basilisk, in that you can coat an area in it rather than having to touch a person directly<br /> <br /> EDIT: Hmm, forgot that you choose a number of mods when you buy the Atavism, not just have whatever mods you can think of. Rethinking my position a little bit<br /> <br /> EDIT: Checked it again. That's not how it works. You have a limited number of mods you can apply at once, but no fixed set of mods.<br /> <br /> Also, I think Shields add to Defense instead of giving armor</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, spores as is would be insanely Overpowered. I'd have it apply the lowest poison rank possible. Or just term it poison and instead inflict a -1 die penalty on physical actions due to causing the runs.<br /> <br /> Remember that skin deep has an extreme downside In that it makes Heroic tracking that much easier, and needs time to activate/deactivate. Spending 5 turns in a fight to get battle ready might work in a DBZ style setting, but most people would rather use that time to get you dead. <br /> <br /> You are right Regarding the shield, my bad.<br /> <br /> It has pretty clear limits, supposed to not be much more powerful than a +2 to a single skill per modification. At most, assuming a Player found a way to Stack them, that would be +10 at Lair 10.<br /> At Lair 10, a Cyclopean Strength using Beast can play Tennis with tanks.<br /> <br /> Having 1-3 modifications at a time in most cases is not too much (downgrading 2L to 2B, dealing 1L unarmed and having 2+lair Higher initiative for example) compared to what other abilities give you.<br /> Plus they can only manifest modifications that reflect the horror (you cannot grow eye stalks or antennae, your Horror is a crocodile! Yes claws would help here, but you said your Kraken has no claws.)<br /> <br /> So it is less a 'unlimited possibilities' Kind of deal, and more a 'I can be more like my horror at the price of being obviously supernatural, causing breaking points and becoming a bit of a torchlight for heroes'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}